111111111111 (acme-nonprod): Resource Explorer supports 649 resource types.
111111111111 (acme-nonprod): Resource Explorer has local indexes only, so tfcensus searches each region on its own. An admin can promote one to an aggregator (`aws resource-explorer-2 update-index-type --type AGGREGATOR`).
